{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cd /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run && ID=$(/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport json;s=json.load(open('\"'state.json'));print([a['id'] for a in s['direct_checks'] if a['id'].startswith('6c0ec62d')][0])\\\") && cd draft && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python - \\\"\"'$ID\" <<'\"'PY'\nimport json,sys\nsub={\\\"action\\\":\\\"review\\\",\n \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Semantic review of the full-history scenario for C1-recovery-adopts-committed-vector (artifact %s, executed as e8ad6c82…). The item assesses requirement versus predicate, the driven history's legality, the oracle, identity, the observation path and the limitations the earlier reviews recorded, one of which this scenario removes.\\\",\n \\\"artifact_id\\\":sys.argv[1],\n \\\"review_items\\\":[{\n  \\\"aspect\\\":\\\"checker_correspondence\\\",\n  \\\"status\\\":\\\"no_issue_found\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"S8-handlePropose-startPhase1\\\",\\\"S9-handlePreAccept\\\",\\\"S10-handlePreAcceptReply\\\",\\\"S13-handleCommit\\\",\\\"S14-recovery-start-prepare\\\",\\\"S15-handlePrepareReply\\\"],\n  \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"完整历史下仍忽略已提交回复并提交 NOOP\\\",\n  \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"先由所有者（副本 1）真实提案并被快速路径提交（proposal_committed: leader_status=4、third_status=4、command_is_put=true，提交仅投递给副本 2），随后副本 0 以默认记录恢复同一实例：仍未采纳 COMMITTED 回复（adopted_committed=false），接受轮完成后以 NOOP 提交（vectors_match=false、all_committed_match=false），应用状态分叉（recoverer (void) 对 peer/third 04）。因此在由真实提案与提交产生的历史中同样成立，先前“已提交记录为预备状态”的限制不再适用。\\\",\n  \\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Requirement versus predicate: the same three properties encode the obligation, and the retained run reports adopted_committed false, vectors_match false and all_committed_match false together with applied_match false, so the assertion is evaluated on printed fields. Entry and legality of the history: the committed record is now produced by the implementation - replica 1, the instance's owner and leader, admits a client proposal through handlePropose, runs a real PreAccept round with replica 2, fast-commits and broadcasts the Commit, which replica 2 installs (both replicas report status 4 with a PUT command in the proposal event). Replica 0 never receives any of those messages because the harness keeps its alive set empty for the proposal, so its lack of a record is a property of the history rather than an installed state; it then enters recovery directly, which remains the declared substitution, and the timeout that would trigger it in production is separately confirmed by claim C8. Oracle and identity: the prerequisite reply that the resolution ignores is emitted by the committed replica itself, and the instance identity, predicates and monitors are the reviewed ones. Limits: the recovery entry is still direct rather than timeout-driven, the configuration is N=3 with Thrifty, and the third replica's record comes from the driven commit; the earlier artifacts that installed the record directly remain superseded by this one for the same obligation. No counterevidence was found in this scope.\\\",\n  \\\"limitations\\\":[\\\"the recovery is entered directly through startRecoveryForInstance; the timeout path that would trigger it in production is confirmed separately (claim C8) but not driven here\\\",\n   \\\"the configuration is N=3 with Thrifty, as in the reviewed artifacts\\\",\n   \\\"the third replica's committed record comes from the driven commit, and the recovering replica's default record is created by the harness because it never received a message about the instance\\\"]}]}\njson.dump(sub,open('submission-review-c1-full.json','w'),indent=2,ensure_ascii=False)\nprint(sub['artifact_id'])\nPY\ncd .. && /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-07_16-54-34-swiftpaxos_epaxos-real-run --submission submission-review-c1-full.json 2>&1 | head -8\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
